@startuml
title SD-F02B — Preview and apply calendar impact
caption FN-CAL-01–04 · To-Be · Frontend, Capacity and Order
actor Merchant
boundary "Capacity Calendar" as UI
control Capacity
database PostgreSQL as DB
Merchant -> UI : Propose closure or cap change
UI -> Capacity : POST impact preview
Capacity -> DB : Read current day revision and affected orders
Capacity --> UI : Counts, order links, canSave and bound token
Merchant -> UI : Confirm reviewed edit
UI -> Capacity : PUT same edit and token
Capacity -> DB : Lock day, recheck version and totals
note over Capacity,DB : Pending Cash and fee intake also advances impact revision
alt Fresh and valid
 DB -> DB : Update calendar and audit, preserve orders
 Capacity --> UI : Saved policy; affected work stays actionable
else Stale or below occupied/used
 Capacity --> UI : Reject and refresh preview
end
@enduml
